completed_at: "2026-09-07T10:57:51.744Z"
claim_principal: claude
author: claude
acceptance_criteria: "No local shell-command-scan.ts remains and the launcher imports pm-ops/attestation; The launcher re-exports the package's own functions by reference, asserted in the suite; The corpus reads the same seven cases as every other converged repository"
close_reason: "Convergence complete. Corpus 15 wrong -> 7 wrong, the seven being the canonical implementation's own open cases, all closed by unbraind/pm-ops#100. Gates: typecheck pass, docstring complete, attestation gate pass, full suite pass / 0 fail, changelog up to date."
body: ""
